  "text": "proprium.sancti-iacobi-apostoli-secreta",
  "about": "The secreta of the formulary “Saint James the Apostle” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "May the holy martyrdom of blessed James, the Apostle, make acceptable the offerings of Your people; and because our own merits are insufficient, may his prayer make them pleasing to You. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
